fenestrium/
├── app.py              ← App entry point, layout, keybindings
├── widgets/
│   ├── classis.py      ← Widget browser pane
│   ├── arbor.py        ← Composition tree pane
│   ├── specularium.py  ← Preview pane (all 3 modes)
│   └── codex.py        ← Code output pane
├── core/
│   ├── registry.py     ← Widget definitions, validated at load
│   ├── tree.py         ← Node dataclass, pure tree operations
│   ├── codegen.py      ← Code generation, all widget types
│   └── session.py      ← Autosave / restore
├── preview/
│   ├── subprocess_preview.py   ← ANSI capture mode
│   ├── inline_preview.py       ← Live mount mode
│   └── svg_preview.py          ← SVG export mode
└── fenestrium.tcss     ← All styles
